5. **[low] A phone clock that's off by more than a minute breaks posting.** The app sets the start time from the phone's clock, and the database allows only one minute of slack. A phone running 2 minutes slow can't post "in 5 minutes" and gets a generic error. The fix is to send only the number of minutes and let the server set the time.

